WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From Low Lunge, right foot forward, back knee down, hips square.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bring the palms together at the heart and lengthen the spine.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Exhale and hook the left elbow outside the right thigh.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Press the palms, lift the chest, and gaze up or forward.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Unwind to center and switch sides.
